rodin-rc (3.10.0+2611-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Switch to the eventb-rossi Rodin Bundle
    (https://github.com/eventb-rossi/Rodin-Bundle), tracking its newest
    release or release candidate, currently 3.10.0-2611.
  * The upstream version encodes the bundle tag: <rodin>+<YYMM>[.<n>][~rc<n>].
  * Require a Java 21 runtime, as the bundle does.

 -- Denis Efremov <efremov@linux.com>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:33:37 +0000

rodin-rc (3.10.0~rc2-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Ubuntu/Debian packaging of the Rodin platform 3.10 RC2.
  * Force the Eclipse light theme via rodin.ini to avoid a broken mixed
    light/dark UI on dark desktops.
  * Force a light GTK theme (GTK_THEME=Adwaita:light) in the launcher so the
    native SWT/GTK widgets are light too, not just the Eclipse-drawn ones.

 -- Denis Efremov <efremov@linux.com>  Sun, 14 Jun 2026 12:00:00 +0000
